      "description": "<p>Polish PM praises police for ‘swift and decisive action’ after threat against him and defence minister revealed</p><p>The Polish prime minister, Donald Tusk, said on Sunday that a man accused of plotting to assassinate him and his defence minister had been detained.</p><p>“The man threatening an attack has been detained,” Tusk wrote on X, praising the police for their “swift and decisive action”.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/oct/11/poland-possible-plot-attack-prime-minister-donald-tusk\">Continue reading...</a>",
